I'm running SYSV 3.0.10, if it matters, and I only have revision 2 of
the Wheaton spoilers.

Help me out, guys; I know I'm doing something wrong, but I don't know
what.

I'm playing a Neutral Wizard, and I want to convert to Lawful.  I do
everything I know to make it happen:  I kill a shopkeeper, I kill a
peaceful Gnome Lord, and I give 400* my level in gold to a Lawful
priest.  Just to be sure, I #pray, and yup, Thoth is offended (I've
never gotten him actually "angry", so I assume this is as upset as he's
ever going to get).  Then I plunk a corpse on the altar and #offer it. 
But the altar gets converted, not me.  What's wrong with this picture?

